@8000 = ~No, perhaps some other time.~

@8001 = ~Yes, go on!~

@8002 = ~What can you do with Snow Leopard Charm?~

@8003 = ~I can combine Snow Leopard Charm, Deep Red Ioun Stone, Lucky Coin of Tymora and Amulet of Protection +1. I will need a Permanency Scroll and 75,000 gold pieces. Do ye want me to continue?~

@8004 = ~With a +3 dagger, Heart of the Golem +2, Stiletto of Demarchess +2, The Grave Binder +2 and Neb's Nasty Cutter, I can forge a very powerful weapon, but it will only be usable by thieves. I'll also need a Manual of Elaboration. It will cost 75,000 gold pieces for ye. Are ye ready?~

@8005 = ~I can combine Boots of The Woodland with a pair of boots of speed and three scrolls of Improved Haste into a pair of boots which will make any ranger who wears them swing faster. I'll also need a Permanency Scroll to make sure that the effect will not gradually fade. It will cost ye 50,000 gold pieces. Are ye ready?~

@8006 = ~Ah! I can't believe what I see here. Have ye found the lost tome of Elven Legacy? It can be used to make an extraordinary potion for any Elf or Half Elf. Unfortunately, it has some missed words, but with the help of a Manual of Elaboration I can fill the blanks. I will also require two King's Tears and 50,000 gold pieces to do the job. What do ye say, me friend?~

@8007 = ~I can combine Shadow Armor, The Night's Gift and Armor of Deep Night together into a grand suit of armor for a thief or a ranger. I will also need three Horn Coral Gems, a spirit Armor scroll, Ring of Duplication, Destroyer of the Hills belt and a Permanency Scroll to complete the task. It will cost ye 75,000 gold pieces because it's not an easy job. Shall I get started?~

@8008 = ~I can combine Night Club, Backwhacker and Sure Strike Club together into a mighty strong club. I will also need a Permanency Scroll to complete the task. It will cost ye 60,000 gold pieces. Shall I get started?~

@8009 = ~What can you do with Backwhacker club?~
